# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real values.

# Live rating badge in the header — Places API (New), place details.
# Both must be present or the badge renders nothing. The key is only ever read on the
# server; it is never sent to the browser. The key must be restricted to the Places API
# and, once hosting is settled, to the server's address.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
# The café's Place ID. Not a secret: it resolves to "Zukis Caffetteria, 3B Queen St,
# Exeter EX4 3SB" and is the same for everyone.
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=ChIJRxz9-QClbUgRigJpc1wN0pc

# Table bookings. "manual": a person at the café confirms each request (the interim
# setting while the capacity rules are provisional). "instant": the table is held on
# submission — the requirement, switched on once the café has confirmed the rules.
BOOKING_CONFIRMATION=manual
